oy it and give it the  respect it deserved our expectations  were somewhat subverted there again  but not quite paris on simply wanted to  win not to hold power which is very  chaotically hisoka in his own way 146  was a lovely experience of connecting  the dots really and i was surprised to  find it so late in the game  so let's see what the last two episodes  hold but that's not for now and i have  to go watch him  so that's it from me if you enjoyed the  found family trope as much as i do  click here here and here share like  subscribe  tell people have a croissant and i'll  see you  next time

